@startuml
title Central Trading System Activity Diagram

start

:Receive instruction from trade client serve;
:Analyze received instruction;
:Divide instruction into kind;
if (Determine instruction kind) then (instruction is a buy instruction)
:Process buy instruction;
if (Check whether buy instruction has matched stock) then (matched stock exists for buy instruction)
:Make buy trade by matching;
:Modify matched buy instruction information;
else (no matched stock exists for buy instruction)
note right: Buy no-match exception: suspend operations and handle no matched stock case
endif
:Provide interface to send messages to other modules;
:Send produced message to network message promulgating;
stop
elseif (Determine instruction kind) then (instruction is a sell instruction)
:Process sell instruction;
if (Check whether sell instruction has matched stock) then (matched stock exists for sell instruction)
:Make sell trade by matching;
:Modify matched sell instruction information;
else (no matched stock exists for sell instruction)
note right: Sell no-match exception: suspend operations and handle no matched stock case
endif
:Provide interface to send messages to other modules;
:Send produced message to network message promulgating;
stop
elseif (Determine instruction kind) then (instruction is a cancel instruction)
:Process cancel instruction;
if (Check whether cancel target instruction exists and is not already implemented) then (target instruction exists and is not already implemented)
:Cancel correlative instruction;
else (target instruction has already been implemented or no matched instruction exists)
note right: Cancel exception: suspend operations, already implemented instruction, or no matched instruction
endif
:Provide interface to send messages to other modules;
:Send produced message to network message promulgating;
stop
elseif (Determine instruction kind) then (instruction is a save-trade-information request)
:Process save trade information request;
:Give out successful trade information;
:Save trade information;
else (instruction is a trading-information query)
:Process trading information query;
if (Validate query and check matched data) then (query is valid and matched data exists)
:Implement query;
:Structuralize queried data;
:Send query result data to release;
else (query is invalid or no matched data exists)
note right: Query exception: suspend operations, invalid query, or no matched data
endif
:Provide interface to send messages to other modules;
:Send produced message to network message promulgating;
stop
endif

@enduml